		(property "Description" "Keystone 3557-2 THT '2 IN 1' auto-blade-fuse-clip holder — TWO INDEPENDENT clip receptacles in one housing (pins 1/2 are separate electrical nodes, NOT a 2-terminal series part). Each position accepts the same universal blade range as the 3557/3577/3586 family (.110-.250in/2.8-6.4mm wide x .020-.032in/0.51-0.81mm thick tabs). 30A/500VAC UL rating, 0.016in (0.41mm) brass tin-nickel contacts, glass-filled Nylon 94V-0 insulator, -50C to +145C. 4 THT solder pins (2 per clip position), 1.6mm drill, 3.4mm row pitch, 13.5mm position-to-position pitch — all verified against Keystone catalog M55 p.41 ('2 IN 1 FUSE HOLDER' table); drill corrected from the EasyEDA/LCSC auto-derived 1.8mm to the datasheet's 1.6mm (.063in dia). CAUTION: physically distinct from the plain single-clip 3557 (top entry, THT)/3577 (bottom entry, THT) universal clip — do not treat as a drop-in for a single-node blade site; see docs/standard-tier-review/blade-fit-check-2026-07-04.md."
